  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij1_omashguh.title": "Find Omashguh",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij1_omashguh.desc": "Above the &6Crystal Cheese Cliffs&r floats a mountain town of cliff cheese: &6Omashguh&r. The mail does not walk there, the mail &oslides&r: from the palace of King Bumi Guh all the way down to the post office. You may too, nyeg. (The Super Compass knows the way: tab End.)",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij1_westelijke_luchttempel.title": "Find the Western Air Temple",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij1_westelijke_luchttempel.desc": "Above the &6Crumb Clouds&r floats an island with nothing but some grass and a fountain. Take a look &ounder&r the island: there hangs the &6Western Air Temple&r, upside down. The entrance is the cellar stairs. The bison stable is empty: the herd has been missing for a while.",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij1_vuurtempel_roku.title": "Find the Fire Temple of Roku Guh",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij1_vuurtempel_roku.desc": "Above the &6Nibble Chorus Forest&r floats an island shaped like a crescent moon, with a red pagoda on it: the &6Fire Temple of Roku Guh&r. All the way at the top are five fire doors side by side. They are shut. Knocking does not help, but it is polite."
}
